{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Blood for the Throne</strong> is a tactical war strategy game with <strong>RPG-style progression</strong>. As a warlord in a brutal medieval world, you must lead your general and troops through relentless battles against monsters, rival generals, and entire kingdoms, all while striving to claim the throne.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/extras/19be648b94bb6c9f1b15154bb7443592.poster.avif?t=1759932712\" width=640 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/extras/19be648b94bb6c9f1b15154bb7443592.webm?t=1759932712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/extras/19be648b94bb6c9f1b15154bb7443592.mp4?t=1759932712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Armies Forged in Steel</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Customize your forces with <strong>forged weapons, armor, and unique perks</strong> that shape their combat style. Different generals bring distinct traits and strategies, allowing you to experiment with varied playstyles. Will you crush enemies with sheer numbers, break their lines with disciplined infantry, or outmaneuver them with cunning cavalry strikes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/extras/ef888b95b213bb7e8e405a032333262f.poster.avif?t=1759932712\" width=640 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/extras/ef888b95b213bb7e8e405a032333262f.webm?t=1759932712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/extras/ef888b95b213bb7e8e405a032333262f.mp4?t=1759932712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Real-Time Strategy, Auto Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Command your troops across the battlefield in real time as combat erupts around you. Direct formations, launch flanks, and shift your lines to counter the enemy\u2019s advance. Smart maneuvers and decisive choices determine the tide of war as your soldiers clash steel and claim glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/extras/e5bc71c6230acb01ca7c2b99a3812fcd.poster.avif?t=1759932712\" width=640 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/extras/e5bc71c6230acb01ca7c2b99a3812fcd.webm?t=1759932712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/extras/e5bc71c6230acb01ca7c2b99a3812fcd.mp4?t=1759932712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Campaign and Skirmish Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Embark on a sweeping campaign across dangerous lands filled with rival lords, roaming monsters, and contested kingdoms. The game offers a variety of battles, each requiring careful strategy and tactical skill to emerge victorious. Outmaneuver enemies, and test your general\u2019s leadership in a dynamic, branching journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Or dive into Skirmish mode, where you can choose specific battle types and experiment with different generals, army compositions, and strategies for quick, replayable challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/extras/bea76de6ba6810cfad088b742fb648c5.poster.avif?t=1759932712\" width=640 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/extras/bea76de6ba6810cfad088b742fb648c5.webm?t=1759932712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/extras/bea76de6ba6810cfad088b742fb648c5.mp4?t=1759932712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Endless Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">No two wars play the same. With a variety of generals, dynamic maps, diverse enemy types, and countless equipment combinations, every run offers fresh strategic choices and unexpected battles. Your strategy evolves as you choose war doctrines and unlock perks for your units, giving each campaign a unique rhythm and style. Adapt your approach, experiment with synergies, and carve your own path to power every time you march to war.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3997440?t=1759932712","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/7aa225189123ae6d6cd1bcf5418f50d09dee2a87/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759932712","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/50f94ba0ea5affdd383253898e2f71584519a6ff/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759932712","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/50f94ba0ea5affdd383253898e2f71584519a6ff/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759932712","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4068180,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Blood for the Throne</strong> is a tactical war strategy game with <strong>RPG-style progression</strong>. As a warlord in a brutal medieval world, you must lead your general and troops through relentless battles against monsters, rival generals, and entire kingdoms, all while striving to claim the throne.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/extras/19be648b94bb6c9f1b15154bb7443592.poster.avif?t=1759932712\" width=640 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/extras/19be648b94bb6c9f1b15154bb7443592.webm?t=1759932712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/extras/19be648b94bb6c9f1b15154bb7443592.mp4?t=1759932712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Armies Forged in Steel</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Customize your forces with <strong>forged weapons, armor, and unique perks</strong> that shape their combat style. Different generals bring distinct traits and strategies, allowing you to experiment with varied playstyles. Will you crush enemies with sheer numbers, break their lines with disciplined infantry, or outmaneuver them with cunning cavalry strikes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/extras/ef888b95b213bb7e8e405a032333262f.poster.avif?t=1759932712\" width=640 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/extras/ef888b95b213bb7e8e405a032333262f.webm?t=1759932712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/extras/ef888b95b213bb7e8e405a032333262f.mp4?t=1759932712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Real-Time Strategy, Auto Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Command your troops across the battlefield in real time as combat erupts around you. Direct formations, launch flanks, and shift your lines to counter the enemy\u2019s advance. Smart maneuvers and decisive choices determine the tide of war as your soldiers clash steel and claim glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/extras/e5bc71c6230acb01ca7c2b99a3812fcd.poster.avif?t=1759932712\" width=640 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/extras/e5bc71c6230acb01ca7c2b99a3812fcd.webm?t=1759932712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/extras/e5bc71c6230acb01ca7c2b99a3812fcd.mp4?t=1759932712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Campaign and Skirmish Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Embark on a sweeping campaign across dangerous lands filled with rival lords, roaming monsters, and contested kingdoms. The game offers a variety of battles, each requiring careful strategy and tactical skill to emerge victorious. Outmaneuver enemies, and test your general\u2019s leadership in a dynamic, branching journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Or dive into Skirmish mode, where you can choose specific battle types and experiment with different generals, army compositions, and strategies for quick, replayable challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/extras/bea76de6ba6810cfad088b742fb648c5.poster.avif?t=1759932712\" width=640 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/extras/bea76de6ba6810cfad088b742fb648c5.webm?t=1759932712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/extras/bea76de6ba6810cfad088b742fb648c5.mp4?t=1759932712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Endless Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">No two wars play the same. With a variety of generals, dynamic maps, diverse enemy types, and countless equipment combinations, every run offers fresh strategic choices and unexpected battles. Your strategy evolves as you choose war doctrines and unlock perks for your units, giving each campaign a unique rhythm and style. Adapt your approach, experiment with synergies, and carve your own path to power every time you march to war.</p>","developers":["Ludus Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/a37780c96b5d161ca6b7794b85d6eee637f9e457/header.jpg?t=1759932712","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/